Internet advertising comprises paid promotional content delivered through online channels such as search engines, social media platforms, video sharing sites and programmatic display networks. Formats range from banner and video ads to native and sponsored posts, each designed either for brand exposure or direct response objectives. Because advertisers can target audiences with granular demographic and behavioural data, campaigns achieve measurable reach while optimizing spend efficiency.
